   "widgets_values": [
    "## hy3d-multiview-workflow.json\n\nHy3D multiview\n\n**Does:** the multiview variant of Hy3D — several consistent views (uniform 512²) feed the\nshape model, which usually beats a single-view guess on occluded geometry.\n**See:** `3d/README.md`, `3d/EXPERIMENTS.md` E2d.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S11** in `HOWTO.md`  ·  Why it is this way: **E2d** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
